; json-lens-tending-band.fk - JSON lens target and real evidence cell proof.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/json.fk form-stdlib/json-lens-tissue.fk

; Band verdict on fkwu today: 189 — and 189 is NOT a score. Re-read 2026-07-25.
;
; A line I wrote here on 2026-07-25 said "255 when every check lands — DERIVED from the
; bit weights ... It currently returns 189", which read 189 as a partial pass. It is not.
; The honest degrade below fires (docs/system_audit/ is absent), the band returns the
; string "json-lens-tending-band-input-absent", and on fkwu that string prints as its raw
; interned handle — 189. Measured: (str_len <the same guard expression>) is 35, the exact
; length of that string.
;
; Why the string prints as a number here: fkwu decides string-vs-number for a program's
; result by walking the ROOT expression (fk_str_root_depth), because a string is carried as
; a bare handle with no runtime tag to ask. For an `if`, BOTH branches have to be
; string-yielding. This band's other branch is an `add`, so the whole result falls to the
; number printer. The degrade idiom is sound; its reading on this arm is what misleads.
; Any sweep that reads this line as an integer sees a bit-sum that was never computed.
;
(do
    ; honest degrade 2026-07-18: the audit-evidence tissue this band reads
    ; (docs/system_audit/) is Coherence-Network tissue and never traveled
    ; into this body when the form kernel became canonical here. When the
    ; evidence cell is absent the band degrades to one stable verdict,
    ; not a crash (the bml-thesis idiom).
    (if (eq (fs_exists "../docs/system_audit/commit_evidence_2026-06-06_carrier_tissue_census.json") 0)
        "json-lens-tending-band-input-absent"
        (do
    (let tending (jlt-tending-from-root ".."))
    (let evidence
        (jlt-evidence-cell
            "../docs/system_audit/commit_evidence_2026-06-06_carrier_tissue_census.json"
            "docs/system_audit/commit_evidence_2026-06-06_carrier_tissue_census.json"))

    (add
        (add
            (add
                (if (str_eq (nth tending 0) "json-lens-tending") 1 0)
                (if (gt (nth tending 1) 800) 2 0))
            (add
                (if (str_eq (nth tending 2) "system-audit-evidence") 4 0)
                (if (gt (nth tending 3) 600) 8 0)))
        (add
            (add
                (if (str_eq (nth tending 4) "audit evidence cells") 16 0)
                (if (str_eq (nth evidence 0) "json-evidence-cell") 32 0))
            (add
                (if (str_eq (nth evidence 2) "Add Form-kernel carrier tissue census and generic source inventory primitive") 64 0)
                (if (str_eq (nth evidence 3) "pass") 128 0)))))))
